    "title": "Jimmy",
    "slug": "jimmy",
    "bio": "Jimmy has been tattooing for over 20 years and is the name behind Jimmy Tattoo, now working out of 666 Tattoo in Lawnton on Brisbane's northside. He works across a variety of styles, including traditional, Japanese and realism, but cover-ups are where his experience really shows. If you've got an old tattoo that's faded, blurred or just isn't you any more, Jimmy can talk you through the options for reworking it or covering it with something you'll love.\n\nTwo decades in the industry means he's seen and fixed just about everything, and he takes the time to plan a design that suits your skin, your placement and the existing ink. Bring in photos of the tattoo you want covered and any reference ideas, and he'll sketch out what's possible.\n\nTo book a consultation with Jimmy, send an enquiry or drop into the Lawnton studio.",
