    "title": "Jeff",
    "slug": "jeff",
    "bio": "Jeff (Jeffrey) has been tattooing since 2017 and works at 666 Tattoo in Lawnton, North Brisbane. He specialises in blackwork, fine line, stipple, realism and portrait tattoos, and his portfolio shows how comfortable he is moving between delicate single-needle work and bold, heavy black pieces.\n\nPortraits and realism take patience and good reference material, so Jeff likes to start with a chat about the image you have in mind, the size and the placement that will do it justice. For fine line and stipple work, he'll help you pick a design that will age well and stay crisp for years.\n\nWhether it's a portrait of someone close to you, a blackwork sleeve or a small fine line piece, send Jeff an enquiry with your idea and any reference photos, or come and see him at the Lawnton studio.",
