    "title": "Lindsay",
    "slug": "lindsay",
    "bio": "Lindsay is our first-year apprentice at 666 Tattoo in Lawnton, North Brisbane, learning the craft under artists with more than 30 years of combined experience. She specialises in neo traditional, florals, fine line and black work, and she's building a portfolio of bright, flowing botanical pieces and clean line work.\n\nAs an apprentice, Lindsay is a great fit for smaller and medium-sized pieces, flash designs and floral work, and every tattoo she does is supervised by the senior artists in the studio. It's a good way to get quality work while supporting a new artist as she develops her style.\n\nIf you'd like a floral or neo traditional piece, send Lindsay an enquiry with your ideas and preferred placement, or pop into the Lawnton studio to see her latest work.",
