    "bio": "Melanie is a tattoo artist at 666 Tattoo in Lawnton, on Brisbane's northside. She's part of a team with more than 30 years of combined experience in the Queensland tattoo industry, working alongside Jimmy, Jeff and Lindsay in our Gympie Road studio.\n\nHave a look through Melanie's work below to get a feel for her style. If you like what you see, the best next step is a chat: send an enquiry with your idea, the size you're thinking of and where it will go, and include any reference images you have. Melanie can then let you know how she'd approach the design and what to expect on the day.\n\nYou're also welcome to drop into the Lawnton studio to talk through your idea in person and browse the rest of the team's portfolios.",
